            "notes": "Dampener grip will help you get in and out of fights. Charge in, swing a few times, charge out. The cd reduction of dampener grip is great. If you aren't getting too much pressure/you have a good pocket, you can just use the cd reduction to pressure more. Otherwise, it's used for getting charge cd down so you have an escape.\n\nBy this time, if the enemy team has solid damage output, your shield may be down more than you'd like. In this sistuation, you should consider cushioned padding and/or charge recycler for reducing stun or anti-heal duration.",
